rained on single-cell sequencing data, with no mention of natural language text input, output, or conditioning. Hence the model lacks a substantive text component and text-bio bridge. | The abstract states scGPT is a generative pre-trained transformer trained on over 33 million cells, indicating a generative architecture with foundation-model pretraining.",EXCLUDE,EC2_no_text_component,,EXCLUDE,EC2_no_text_component,,False
