nt"": ""no"", ""foundation_model_evidence"": ""yes"", ""primary_exclusion_code"": ""EC3_not_generative"", ""uncertainty_reason"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_text_component"": ""not_assessed"", ""evidence_for_text_bio_bridge"": ""not_assessed"", ""evidence_for_generative_model"": ""none"", ""boundary_case"": ""clear_exclude"", ""decision_rationale"": ""The abstract describes fine-tuning scGPT for ligand-receptor interaction prediction, a discriminative task, with no mention of decoder, autoregressive, or other generative mechanisms.""}",primary_model_paper,no,yes,EC3_not_generative,none,not_assessed,not_assessed,none,clear_exclude,"The abstract describes fine-tuning scGPT for ligand-receptor interaction prediction, a discriminative task, with no mention of decoder, autoregressive, or other generative mechanisms.",UNCERTAIN,EXCLUDE,True,"{""paper_type"": ""primary_model_paper"", ""bio_modality_present"": ""yes"", ""text_component_present"": ""no"", ""text_bio_bridge_present"": ""no"", ""generative_model_present"": ""no"", ""foundation_model_evidence"": ""yes"", ""primary_exclusion_code"": ""EC2_no_text_component"", ""uncertainty_reason"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_text_component"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_text_bio_bridge"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_generative_model"": ""none"", ""boundary_case"": ""clear_exclude"", ""decision_rationale"": ""The abstract describes fine-tuning a single-cell foundation model (scGPT) for ligand-receptor interaction prediction with no natural-language text component, text-bio bridge, or explicit generative mechanism.""}",primary_model_paper,yes,no,no,no,yes,EC2_no_text_component,none,none,none,none,clear_exclude,"The abstract describes fine-tuning a single-cell foundation model (scGPT) for ligand-receptor interaction prediction with no natural-language text component, text-bio bridge, or explicit generative mechanism.",UNCERTAIN|EXCLUDE,primary_model_paper,yes,no,no,no,yes,EC2_no_text_component,,none,none,none,clear_exclude,"The abstract des