t":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is an inference-only wrapper around pretrained vision foundation models plus kNN search, rather than a new text-bio model. The abstract emphasizes embeddings and no task-specific retraining.","evidence_snippet":"“purely in an inference-only mode” and “Combining the generated embeddings”"},{"record_id":"rec_000229","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a review of pathomics for liver cancer, not a primary candidate model paper. The abstract focuses on automated pathology image analysis.","evidence_snippet":"“This review highlights how AI-driven pathomics has revolutionized liver cancer management”"},{"record_id":"rec_000230","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"Primary multimodal deep learning study on genotype and gene expression for Alzheimer’s disease. The abstract does not describe a substantive text/language component.","evidence_snippet":"“integrating genotype and gene expression data” and “deep, multi-layer information fusion model”"},{"record_id":"rec_000231","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is an original deep learning method for drug-target interaction screening with drug compounds and protein targets. No substantive text modality or text-bio bridge is described.","evidence_snippet":"“MINER-DTI dataset” with “drug compounds, and protein targets” and “deep cross-modal attention modelling”"},{